        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether the government\u2019s argument that an employee must actually transfer title to the property to be considered making a sale is consistent with the statute."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "57f0f655739db3c5aec3f82a8580018a81d115e138f3d1327d49a85c2e21de62",
            "evidence_ids": [
